# WS2-02. # Sources: spec/03-ownership.md §3 (moves; a moved value is never dropped), §5 (drop order: locals in reverse declaration order, struct fields in declaration order, array elements first to last, parameters after the body locals; drops on every return/break/continue; exactly once), spec/04-expressions.md §3 (temporaries drop at statement end in reverse creation order).
 Body locals drop in reverse order (3, 2), then the parameter (1).
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: output
contrast: let y: Tok = tok(3); ==> let y: Tok = tok(4);
contrast-expect: output
--- output
body
drop 3
drop 2
drop 1
end
--- contrast-output
body
drop 4
drop 2
drop 1
end
